wf-round-setup-scenario-faction = Faction crew
wf-round-setup-faction-description = Deploy together aboard a faction ship. Choose a faction job you qualify for, a vessel from its shipyard (T0 or T1 for TSF and PDV), and openings at or below your own command rank. Normal faction job limits, equipment and TSF/PDV population balancing still apply.
wf-round-setup-faction-tsf = TSF Marine Corps
wf-round-setup-faction-pdv = Phaethon Dynasty Vanguard
wf-round-setup-faction-vg = Viper Group
wf-round-setup-faction-ussp = USSP
wf-round-setup-faction-underground = The Underground
wf-round-setup-faction-start = Faction crew — { $faction }
wf-round-setup-faction-unavailable = Select a character eligible for an available job in this faction. This map must offer faction jobs; job bans, qualifications and open station slots still apply.
wf-round-setup-faction-rank-help = Your selected job sets the recruitment ceiling. Each recruit must qualify for their own job. Existing faction slots are used when you deploy, and official faction job titles are retained.
wf-round-setup-faction-slot-unavailable = That faction job has no open station slot. Choose another available role before deploying.
wf-round-setup-faction-balance = This faction currently has more players. Wait for the factions to balance before deploying.
wf-round-setup-faction-titles-fixed = Faction roles use their official job titles and cannot be renamed.
wf-round-setup-ship-start-faction = Faction base
wf-round-setup-ship-start-faction-help = Begin at your faction's base. Dock at a compatible berth, or spawn in clear space nearby if the docks are full.
wf-round-setup-ship-no-station-space = The selected station is unavailable or has no clear space nearby. You have not been charged. Try another starting location.
wf-round-setup-ship-name = Ship name
wf-round-setup-ship-name-placeholder = Leave blank to use the ship's original name
wf-round-setup-ship-name-help = Choose the name shown on the ship, its deed and shuttle records. Press Enter or Next to save. The name is fixed when this crew launches.
wf-round-setup-ship-named = Ship: { $name }
wf-round-setup-member-joined = { $name } has joined your crew as { $role }.
